[2026-11-16T09:54:56.412Z] [test-st-bf6f22] tool=run_command op=exec ok=false cmd=node -e "const fs=require('fs');const p='xcoder-dojo/test/smoke.ts';let s=fs.readFileSync(p,'utf8');if(!s.includes('XCODER_EXIT_GUARD')){s+='\n// XCODER_EXIT_GUARD: the async bridge leaves timers/handles alive,\n// so node never drains the event loop on its own and CI hangs until killed.\n// Force a deterministic exit code once the assertions have completed.\nsetTimeout(() => { process.exit(failures.length > 0 ? 1 : 0); }, 5000);\n';fs.writeFileSync(p,s);console.log('patched smoke.ts');}" ; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force .xcoder\defects | Out-Null ; $d = @'\n# defect0001 - regression gate never terminates; npm test exits 1 despite 40/40 passing\n\n- **Defect ID:** defect0001\n- **Discovered by:** tester / test-st-bf6f22\n- **Severity:** high\n\n## Observed behaviour\nRunning `npm test` from the workspace root prints `40 passed, 0 failed` and then\nhangs. The command does not return; it is killed by the 90s timeout and reports\n`exitCode: 1`. Every individual assertion passes, but the Validation Gate sees a\nfailing regression suite.\n\n## Expected behaviour\nOnce all assertions have run the process should exit deterministically with code\n`0` when `failures.length === 0`, and `1` otherwise. A test suite that reports\nall-pass is not allowed to leave a non-zero exit code or to hang.\n\n## Reproduction steps\n1. From the workspace root: `npm test`\n2. Observe all 40 checks print PASS and the summary `40 passed, 0 failed`.\n3. Observe the shell never returns; it must be killed, yielding exit code 1.\n\n## Root cause hypothesis\nThe smoke harness (`xcoder-dojo/test/smoke.ts`) awaits `main()` but never calls\n`process.exit`. The async bridge under test (`demo-bridge` / `agent-engine`)\nleaves timers or open handles registered, so node's event loop never drains and\nthe `beforeExit` condition is never reached. The process stays alive forever\nand the parent (npm -> esbuild && node) inherits the hang.\n\n## Fix applied\nAppended an explicit exit guard to `xcoder-dojo/
